/v1/","context":{"app_id":4811080,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4811080-1846651706675462","game_id":"steam-4811080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Controller Support, Improvements & Release Date Update","summary":"This update focuses on feedback and issues found during recent playtesting.Added Controller Support No Visitors Allowed can now be played using a controller, including menu and settings navigation.Added Arrow Key Movement Players can now use the arrow keys as an alternative to WASD. During playtesting, I noticed this was important for some left-handed players and players with accessibility needs.Improved Tutorial Guidance The tutorial prompt will now appear again whenever the player returns to H","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T19:49:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675462","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811080-1845383656385614","game_id":"steam-4811080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Steam Achievements, New Anomaly & Improvements","summary":"A new update for the No Visitors Allowed Demo is now live.This build adds Steam Achievements, including several hidden achievements and easter eggs for players who like to explore and experiment with the hallway.I have also added a new anomaly, improved the system that determines which anomalies appear, and made several visual and performance improvements throughout the demo. What’s NewAdded Steam AchievementsAdded several hidden achievements and easter eggsAdded a new anomalyImproved the anomal","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T09:36:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385614","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811080-1840944183784515","game_id":"steam-4811080","kind":"announcement","title":"No Visitors Allowed Featured on IGN!","summary":"We are incredibly excited to share that No Visitors Allowed has been featured on IGN’s main YouTube channel!As a solo developer working on my first game, seeing No Visitors Allowed on IGN is a milestone I never imagined reaching.A huge thank you to everyone who has played the demo, wishlisted the game, shared feedback, or supported the project so far. Your support means a lot and continues to help shape the game.🎬 Watch the trailer on IGN: The No Visitors Allowed Demo is available now on Steam, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T19:41:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784515","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811080-1840310314353351","game_id":"steam-4811080","kind":"announcement","title":"No Visitors Allowed Demo Launches Today!","summary":"The No Visitors Allowed demo goes live today, August 11! You will be able to play starting at:UTC: 3:00 PM United States (East): 11:00 AM EDT United States (West): 8:00 AM PDT UK: 4:00 PM BST Central Europe: 5:00 PM CEST Russia: 6:00 PM MSK Brazil: 12:00 PM BRT China: 11:00 PM CST Japan: 12:00 AM JST (August 12) Explore the looping halls of an abandoned hospital, watch carefully for anomalies, and find your way out.Thank you to everyone who has wishlisted and supported No Visitors Allowed so far","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T07:17:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314353351","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811080-1836506165571583","game_id":"steam-4811080","kind":"announcement","title":"No Visitors Allowed First Public Playtest Has Ended","summary":"Hi Everyone, The first public playtest for No Visitors Allowed has now ended.Thank you so much to everyone who played, shared feedback, or reported issues. I will now go through everything and work on improvements ahead of the demo.This was only the first playtest, so more updates are coming.Thank you again.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T22:25:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165571583","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4811080-1836506165554144","game_id":"steam-4811080","kind":"announcement","title":"No Visitors Allowed First Public Playtest Goes Live Tonight","summary":"Hi Everyone, The first public playtest for No Visitors Allowed goes live tonight. Central Europe: 7:00 PM CESTUK: 6:00 PM BSTRussia: 8:00 PMUSA East: 1:00 PM EDTUSA Central: 12:00 PM CDTUSA West: 10:00 AM PDTChina: 1:00 AMThis is an early playtest build, not the final demo. The goal is to test the core experience, gather feedback, and understand how the atmosphere, pacing, and anomaly system feel to players before the demo release.Please keep in mind that this playtest is intentionally limited a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T14:32:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165554144","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4811080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:2